        <tr id="comment-body-448169"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <h5><a name="OriginallyaddedtoECSL242709https%3A%2F%2Feasystack.atlassian.net%2Fbrowse%2FECSL242709at22%2FApr%2F256%3A24PM"></a>Originally added to <a href="https://easystack.atlassian.net/browse/ECSL2-42709" class="external-link" rel="nofollow noreferrer">ECSL2-42709</a> at 22/Apr/25 6:24 PM</h5>

<p>该集群资源使用率较高，虚机关机的原因全部都是因为发生OOM被kill掉了。</p>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/351964" alt="be27765111a2f9d0fcf14924c27af36-20250422-102432.png" height="849" width="1663" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>

