        </td></tr>
        <tr id="comment-body-448170"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <h5><a name="OriginallyaddedtoECSL242709https%3A%2F%2Feasystack.atlassian.net%2Fbrowse%2FECSL242709at23%2FApr%2F254%3A25PM%2Clasteditedby%E5%AD%9F%E4%BD%A9https%3A%2F%2Feasystack.atlassian.net%2Fpeople%2F557058%3A8fab0584c9a94550ad49dac6c71db05eat24%2FApr%2F259%3A00AM"></a>Originally added to <a href="https://easystack.atlassian.net/browse/ECSL2-42709" class="external-link" rel="nofollow noreferrer">ECSL2-42709</a> at 23/Apr/25 4:25 PM, last edited by <a href="https://easystack.atlassian.net/people/557058:8fab0584-c9a9-4550-ad49-dac6c71db05e" class="external-link" rel="nofollow noreferrer">孟佩</a> at 24/Apr/25 9:00 AM</h5>

<p>node-4 是计算存储融合节点，操作系统预留3G内存，kubepod 预留10G，5个OSD，每个OSD预留4G，共20G，所以总预留内存是 33G，<br/>
总内存 383G-33G=350G，所以node-4节点给虚机的可用内存就是 350G。</p>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/351956" alt="1e72f95b6705a682a1c6b87e560e98f-20250423-082528.png" height="790" width="1702" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/351959" alt="3b8a83c93b19972b0e0b7e48fc5557e-20250423-082548.png" height="505" width="1822" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/351965" alt="image-20250423-083959.png" height="383" width="1645" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>

<p>内存超售比是1，并未超分。</p>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/351966" alt="image-20250424-010046.png" height="610" width="975" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>
        </td></tr>
