        <tr id="comment-body-448171"><td bgcolor="#ffffff">
            <h5><a name="OriginallyaddedtoECSL242709https%3A%2F%2Feasystack.atlassian.net%2Fbrowse%2FECSL242709at24%2FApr%2F259%3A21AM"></a>Originally added to <a href="https://easystack.atlassian.net/browse/ECSL2-42709" class="external-link" rel="nofollow noreferrer">ECSL2-42709</a> at 24/Apr/25 9:21 AM</h5>

<ol>
	<li>查看几台虚机的规格，有一台是64G内存，其余都是32G内存。<br/>
<span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/351967" alt="image-20250424-010123.png" height="122" width="661" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></li>
	<li>查看几台虚机发生oom被kill时的信息；RSS看起来都不高，但是被kill时 anon-rss 均已经接近虚机内存的规格限制32G或者64G。
<div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"><div class="preformattedContent panelContent">
<pre>Apr 22 14:51:12 node-4 kernel: [50177] 42436 50177   580000   493265(RSS)  4980736        0          1000 qemu-kvm
Apr 17 14:28:39 node-4 kernel: [50995] 42436 50995   567582   494022(RSS)  4915200        0          1000 qemu-kvm
Apr 17 10:41:10 node-3 kernel: [48066] 42436 48066  1123187  1026275(RSS)  9240576        0          1000 qemu-kvm
Apr 15 09:48:58 node-4 kernel: [51116] 42436 51116   567554   509350(RSS)  4784128        0          1000 qemu-kvm
Apr 15 09:48:58 node-4 kernel: [50036] 42436 50036   567404   494919(RSS)  4849664        0          1000 qemu-kvm</pre>
</div></div>
<div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"><div class="preformattedContent panelContent">
<pre>Apr 22 14:51:13 node-4 kernel: Out of memory: Killed process 50177 (qemu-kvm) total-vm:37120000kB, anon-rss:31568960kB, file-rss:0kB, shmem-rss:0kB
Apr 17 14:28:39 node-4 kernel: Out of memory: Killed process 50995 (qemu-kvm) total-vm:36325248kB, anon-rss:31617408kB, file-rss:0kB, shmem-rss:0kB
Apr 17 10:41:10 node-3 kernel: Out of memory: Killed process 48066 (qemu-kvm) total-vm:71883968kB, anon-rss:65681600kB, file-rss:0kB, shmem-rss:0kB
Apr 15 09:48:58 node-4 kernel: Out of memory: Killed process 51116 (qemu-kvm) total-vm:36323456kB, anon-rss:32598400kB, file-rss:0kB, shmem-rss:0kB
Apr 15 19:11:59 node-4 kernel: Out of memory: Killed process 50036 (qemu-kvm) total-vm:36313856kB, anon-rss:31674816kB, file-rss:0kB, shmem-rss:0kB</pre>
</div></div></li>
	<li>目前不太清楚这里面的机制，请L3帮忙看下，虚机为何会发生OOM被kill掉，需要跟客户解释一下，谢谢。</li>
</ol>

        </td></tr>
