<p>计算所有qemu进程内存占用：</p>

<div class="preformatted panel" style="border-width: 1px;"><div class="preformattedContent panelContent">
<pre>yuchen@ubuntu~ s=0;for i in `cat oominfo.sh |grep qemu | awk '{print $10}'`;
do let s=s+$i;done;
echo $s

4711203

echo $((4711203*64/1024/1024)) = 287G</pre>
</div></div>

<p>qemu-kvm进程15个，占用了287GB.  ceph-osd占用近16G左右，再加上系统其他各种服务，应该有300G+。</p>
